, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216486955", "author": {"steamid": "76561199350105704", "personaname": "Simson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199350105704/", "num_games_owned": 15, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 54, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 54, "last_played": 1766687328, "avatar": "97e463a36f2693f6158631fb69c4074694019c20"}, "language": "english", "review": ".", "timestamp_created": 1769017091, "timestamp_updated": 1769017091, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216458142", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122390362", "personaname": "MockingJay", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mockingjaygames/", "num_games_owned": 219, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1394, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 555, "last_played": 1770100362, "avatar": "11f15ea6df7e32246cd6a94ac32693d99bb33860"}, "language": "english", "review": "The gameplay would be pretty solid if it wasn't the buggiest mess I've ever encountered. From the moment I booted it up the game was acting strangely, only opening in the background and requiring me to manually minimize Steam to even see it. After that, the opening cutscene was abruptly cut off near the end, and from there on after, everything from the tutorial to the main menu to the first solo missions were plagued by constant interruptions due to a lost connection to the server. Even reading something on a single screen could be interrupted in this way. On my last mission I ran into a glitch that caused most of my abilities to be disabled. If this is what the single-player content is like, I dread to imagine how bad the multiplayer would be.\n\nUpdate: I've had a significantly smoother experience after that first session. It still stutters or skips occasionally, but no major disconnects, thankfully. Having gotten to play the game properly, I managed to enjoy some aspects. It seems a bit barebones in some regards, and the number of garbage items I have to sort through is rather unpleasant. I don't really know what I want to do with the crafting system, and frankly I'd rather not deal with it at all. I hope to try out classic mode soon, as I'm very fond of roguelike games. I just wonder if there's actually enough content to justify it.", "timestamp_created": 1768980801, "timestamp_updated": 1769051933, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216426353", "author": {"steamid": "76561199616663562", "personaname": "DisassembledABunnnyonceagain", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199616663562/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1223, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 577, "last_played": 1770372171, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a good game. Very stuttery for me. I wish there were more servers or a singleplyer version so I could negate the lag problem. If this wasn't an issue i'd definitely play it more. There's also a problem with the amulets displaying the code names instead of the display names. Hopefully that gets fixed also.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1768937810, "timestamp_updated": 1768957517, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.551149189472198486", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}]}